Author:     ZT-AIA <1028681969@qq.com>
AuthorDate: Sat Oct 10 21:38:35 2026 +0800
Commit:     GitHub <noreply@github.com>
CommitDate: Sat Oct 10 21:38:35 2026 +0800

    [Refactor] Remove StoreKVBlock optimization and c8_enable_reshape_optim switch (#18128)
    
    ## Description
    
    The StoreKVBlock grouped cache-write optimization for LightningIndexer
    C8 is no longer used. This PR removes it end to end:
    
    - The `c8_enable_reshape_optim` config switch and its derived
    `c8_reshape_optim_enabled` state in `ascend_config.py`
    - The `store_kv_block` call path in
    `AscendSFAIndexerBackend.write_cache`, which now exclusively uses
    `scatter_cache`
    - The group metadata plumbing (`group_len` / `group_key_idx` /
    `group_key_cache_idx`) threaded through the indexer metadata builder,
    `AscendCommonAttentionMetadata`, the model runner buffers, and the
    spec-decode proposer
    - The C++ operator implementations (`csrc/attention/store_kv_block`,
    `csrc/attention/store_kv_block_metadata`), their torch binding
    definitions, `build_aclnn.sh` entries, and the e2e test
    - Related UT cases and documentation entries (`additional_config.md`,
    GLM5/GLM5.2 tutorials, zh_CN `.po`)
    
    ## Test
    
    - `python -m py_compile` on all modified Python sources
    - Updated UTs: `tests/ut/attention/test_indexer.py`, `test_sfa_v1.py`,
    `test_cache_store.py`, `test_sfa_nope_metadata.py`,
    `tests/ut/ops/test_mla.py`, `tests/ut/test_ascend_config.py`,
    `tests/ut/model_loader/rfork/test_identity_validation.py`
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: ZT-AIA <1028681969@qq.com>

